      <marc:subfield code="a">Do you know your Stegosaurus from your Brachiosaurus, or a Diplodocus from a Triceratops? If not, then this fun and fact-filled book of prehistoric projects is a must-have. All dino-obsessed children and grown-ups alike will love these quirky knitted toys and with 15 different patterns to choose from there is no excuse not to get knitting. New knitters need not worry, as there is a techniques section that covers all the basics you&apos;ll need to know. Gallery pages show off the dinosaurs from every angle so you can get up close and personal with these prehistoric creatures.</marc:subfield>
